  "bodyHash": "CsFnVbhZ6dQ=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/398/125/furniturebanner.png\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=plastic&amp;logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></strong></span> 使用 Exline 的家具模組改造你的 Minecraft 世界，舒適與創意在此完美結合！進入一個每個方塊和物品都經過精心設計的領域，提升你的室內外生活空間。無論是小屋的溫馨角落，還是城市的繁華中心，這個模組都為你的遊戲帶來一絲真實與優雅。</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">主要特色：</span></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>多樣家具：</strong>從多種家具中選擇，包括各種木材類型和鮮豔羊毛顏色的椅子、能搭配任何風格的桌子，以及增添層次感的裝飾窗簾。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>互動裝飾：</strong>以前所未有的方式與環境互動。坐在柔軟的椅子上、開關燈光和電視，並與各種廚房家電互動，讓你的家充滿生機。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>戶外升級：</strong>用磚塊或石頭製成的鳥浴盆提升你的花園，並在時尚的 Adirondack 椅上放鬆，邀請你享受日落。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>季節更新：</strong>透過主題更新讓你的世界與季節同步，引入節日裝飾和恐怖元素來慶祝特殊場合。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>伺服器相容：</strong>與朋友分享美麗居家空間的喜悅。此模組可在伺服器上無縫運作，讓你以時尚方式社交。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">有了 Exline 的家具模組，每個方塊都是表達自我、為你的冒險創造完美氛圍的機會。無論是裝飾一個古樸的村莊小屋還是宏偉的城堡，這個模組都為你的 Minecraft 體驗增添了深度和個性。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fexlinemods.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/b3784fc8-73a8-4ed5-9033-feb6c6f2806c/blob-19e676c.png/:/rs=w:149,h:149,cg:true,m/cr=w:149,h:149/qt=q:95\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"149\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/73838725-ba9a-49e1-83b8-c87b658405cb.webp\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你有興趣支持我和我的模組開發嗎？如果是的話，我建議你試試 BisectHosting。作為新客戶，使用代碼：EXLINE，即可在第一個月獲得遊戲伺服器 25% 的折扣。憑藉 24/7 支援和快速回應時間，你可以期待滿足所有遊戲需求的出色服務。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/downloads_blueb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"32\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1204.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1202.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1201.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.20\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_120.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1194.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1193.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1192.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.19\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_119.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1182.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1181.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1171.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-furniture/files?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/ver_icon_1165.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/335deac6-03bd-417c-a074-c54c6d6516d1.png\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/77/livingroom.png\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>椅子</strong></span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 所有木材類型和羊毛顏色的椅子。現在你也可以在椅子上添加兩塊地毯來製作軟墊椅子。手裡沒拿東西時按右鍵即可坐下。按左 Shift 鍵下馬（離開椅子）。由木質半磚和木棍製成。地毯用於製作軟墊。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/850/charrs.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/395/803/icansit.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>青蛙椅</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 使用不同顏色的地毯和混凝土來製作不同顏色的青蛙椅。必須使用相同顏色的混凝土和地毯才能製作出該顏色的青蛙椅。&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/852/froggychair.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>阿迪朗達克椅</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">新添加的木質椅子，非常適合戶外擺放。由木質半磚和木棍製成。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/856/chairsadirondackall.GIF\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"316\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>桌子</strong></span><br>所有木材類型的桌子，不僅限於橡木。使用木質半磚和木棍製作。還有看起來更時尚的玻璃桌子。使用相同材料並加一塊玻璃片製作。&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/857/tables.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>窗簾</strong></span><br>所有顏色的窗簾，可以打開和關閉。使用任何一種顏色的羊毛和一根木棍製作。打開時，可以透過窗簾進行互動。因此，如果窗簾後面有推拉窗，你也可以將其打開。由羊毛和木棍製成。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/858/drapes.gif\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>窗戶</strong></span><br>幾種窗戶，其中一種可以打開和關閉。可使用任何類型的木材製作&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/859/windows.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>廚房裝飾</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>水龍頭</strong></span> - 裝飾用水龍頭，如果放在鍋釜上，可以打開。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">烤麵包機</span></strong> - 裝飾用烤麵包機，可以彈起和降下吐司。僅供裝飾用途。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>烤箱和冰箱</strong></span> - 更多廚房裝飾！它們目前只能打開和關閉，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">不能</span>烹飪或儲存物品。&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/860/kitchen.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>吊扇</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">吊扇需要電源才能開啟，可以透過右鍵點擊來啟動。共有三種模式：關閉、低速和高速。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/861/fans.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>復古電視和舊電視</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">電視需要電源，可以透過右鍵點擊電視在多個「頻道」之間切換。&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/862/retrotv.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/863/old_tv.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>鳥浴盆</strong> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">另一個花園裝飾。由磚塊或石磚製成。&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/864/bird-baths.gif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>花卉佈置</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">目前可以製作四種不同的花卉佈置。每種包含三種不同的花朵。使用特定的花朵來製作每種佈置。&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/865/flowers.gif\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>馬桶<br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">有人又把馬桶蓋掀起來了。b按住 Shift 鍵同時右鍵點擊馬桶可以掀開和放下馬桶蓋。b你可以掀開或放下馬桶蓋坐馬桶。&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/866/toilet.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>恐怖更新！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此更新添加了一些恐怖裝飾：殭屍手臂裝飾、屍殼手臂裝飾、蜘蛛娃娃、洞穴蜘蛛娃娃、骷髏娃娃、凋零骷髏娃娃、墓碑和蛛網窗戶</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/867/spooky_update.gif\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/869/cobweb-windows.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>燈具</strong></span> - 可開關，無須連接電源，因其內建能源供應！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">梳妝台</span></strong> - 僅供裝飾，Forge 版本無法開啟，但 Fabric 版本可正常運作。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/662/870/lamp-and-dresser.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/L120zAyZCyk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Exline 的其他模組</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">（點擊展開）</p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bark-carpets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/953/banner_barkcarpets.png\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/269/doors.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-awnings\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/952/banner_awnings.png\"></a></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">請小心假冒網站，例如 9Minecraft。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">我目前僅在 CurseForge 和 Modrinth 上傳模組，雖然部分舊模組仍在 PlanetMinecraft 上。請勿從此類網站下載我的任何模組（或任何模組），這不安全，且沒有人有權上傳他人的作品。請注意安全並廣為宣傳，在可行的情況下檢舉此類網站，感謝大家的支持！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/Exlines-Furniture-Mod-fake.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p>",
